WEBVTT

00:03:58.651 --> 00:04:01.779
and I wrote, “This is a comfy 
sleeping position!”

00:04:03.990 --> 00:04:06.492
I taped it up on the wall above her bed,

00:04:06.492 --> 00:04:07.576
and I left.

00:04:08.536 --> 00:04:10.871
And suddenly I felt
I didn’t need to keep standing

00:04:10.871 --> 00:04:12.164
at the side of the highway.

00:04:12.164 --> 00:04:14.750
As if I just planted a big sign
at the side of the road

00:04:14.750 --> 00:04:16.335
that anyone passing by would see,

00:04:16.335 --> 00:04:17.336
and I could go home.

00:04:18.045 --> 00:04:19.171
Thanks to that picture,

00:04:19.171 --> 00:04:20.464
I got a good night’s sleep.

00:04:21.507 --> 00:04:22.591
And so did my mom.

00:04:22.800 --> 00:04:24.427
When I went back the next morning,

00:04:24.427 --> 00:04:27.305
I saw that someone had
propped up her left arm with a pillow.

00:04:27.305 --> 00:04:29.807
A nurse who I’d never met
had seen the picture

00:04:29.807 --> 00:04:30.808
and known what to do.